1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,303
See when work lands, who has room, and what
it could cost.

2
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:06,025
Open Gantt in a project.

3
00:00:06,267 --> 00:00:09,911
Switch from weeks to months or years, or
choose custom dates.

4
00:00:11,033 --> 00:00:13,752
Workload spreads estimates across working
days.

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:17,734
Enter a weekly capacity to see where planned
work exceeds it.

6
00:00:18,867 --> 00:00:20,967
As an administrator, open Team.

7
00:00:21,233 --> 00:00:23,374
Set a rate and currency for a member.

8
00:00:24,467 --> 00:00:27,961
In Workload, planned hours times the rate
give an estimate.

9
00:00:28,200 --> 00:00:31,525
In a team, only administrators see the rates
and amounts.

10
00:00:32,667 --> 00:00:34,901
Adjust the plan before the week fills up.
